esection margin  Adjacent to this cavity is an ill defined firm white fibrotic area measuring approximately REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  and located 0 7cm from the black inked deep resection margin  4 0cm from the superior aspect of the specimen  0 5cm from the anterior margin  skin resection margin   and 8 0cm from the medial margin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma consists of unremarkable yellow adipose tissue without nodules or masses noted  In the axillary region multiple lymph nodes ranging in size from 0 5cm to 1 0cm are encountered  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODES  A  skin surface with closest approximation to previously described fibrotic area  0 1cm lateral to nipple   B  fibrotic area to black inked deep posterior resection  C  fibrotic area with biopsy cavity and black inked deep resection margin  D  biopsy cavity  anterior aspect  E  additional section of fibrotic area F  nipple G  H  additional section of nipple with adjacent fibrotic area I  grossly unremarkable breast parenchyma away from mass  3 0cm from medial  J  grossly unremarkable breast parenchyma 2 0cm from lateral margin  K  additional section of unremarkable breast parenchyma 3 0cm from medial margin  L T  lymph nodes located in axillary region  Resident  CHRISTINE GARCIA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin Hughes MD PART   BREAST LEFT  MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , No.
